            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about this: “Don’t fight Jackie Chan in the supermarket! You’re not going to win because he has so many things to use to fight.” More importantly, the game is about the “spirit of wuxia”. This means it’s not only about how you fight, but also why you fight. Battles are not just cool "
